These data files come from the OWASP CRS (Core Rule Set) project, https://github.com/coreruleset/coreruleset,
commit 8c92792bce182c654ba04e22018710209891d6ea (2026-11-23), directory rules/, unchanged:

  lfi-os-files.data      operating-system files an attacker reads through a file parameter (CRS 930120)
  restricted-files.data  files a web server should never hand out (CRS 930130)
  unix-shell.data        shell programs and variables in parameters (CRS 932160)
  sql-errors.data        database error messages in responses (CRS 951)
  php-errors.data        PHP error messages in responses (CRS 953)
  web-shells-php.data    output of known PHP web shells in responses (CRS 955)

Copyright the OWASP CRS project and contributors. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE in
